# Deep links

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/workspace-messenger-route.lib.ts`, `packages/web/src/shared/lib/deeplinks.ts`, and `packages/electron/src/deeplink-route.lib.ts`.

- Use Workspace builders with organization, project, and UUID scope. Do not introduce numeric Zulip routes into new messenger navigation.
- Preserve message anchors and URL encoding. Treat externally supplied routes as untrusted input; use the existing parser/validator.
- BrowserRouter, Electron HashRouter, share URLs, and `workspace://` links have different envelopes around the internal route.
- Tray navigation is resolved by `packages/web/src/app/app-electron-navigation.lib.ts`; preserve the last-messenger-route behavior.
- Verify both generation and parsing, including invalid links and unavailable destination scope, when a route contract changes.
